        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5a450bab-f29b-3097-be2b-c8a96ddcab56",
                "word": "неправильно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                        "entry_id": "5a450bab-f29b-3097-be2b-c8a96ddcab56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к неправильный; неправильным образом, не так, как следует"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e34eede-739f-42bc-b4d9-a89aeed3e575",
                                "sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                                "text": "Всякое слово, которое я слышал из их разговора, не только казалось мне бессмысленно, но неправильно, просто не по французски (ce n’est pas Francais, говорил я себе мысленно)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0555db79-a4c4-4a0d-84b8-aab764fa0fdf",
                                "sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                                "text": "Кривая, неправильная улица, обведённая плетнями и частоколами, вывела нас на такую же криво, неправильно, но прочно устроенную плотину."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8f7429c-b7a9-4817-8a29-5fb369b3e39f",
                                "sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                                "text": "Вы требуете справедливости, вы, которые сами насквозь проникнуты ненавистями и неправосудием всякого рода, вы, которые шагу не можете ступить без того, чтобы не допросить с пристрастием, чтобы не кинуть тени язвительного подозрения, чтобы не уськнуть и не кивнуть головой на тех, которых вы, правильно или неправильно, считаете врагами вашего спокойствия!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d328abb0-11d7-4258-9878-57b4da419844",
                                "sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                                "text": "Вы хотите осушить луг, если вы правильно провели канавы, луг осушён и получается хорошее пастбище, если провели неправильно, то, несмотря на массу потраченного для рытья канав труда, луг не высох и остаётся всё то же бесполезное болото."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "874ec08d-2d58-40fa-bbae-10fd9f5bd6fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a450bab-f29b-3097-be2b-c8a96ddcab56",
                        "source_sense_id": "77257ddd-ed0b-35c3-90d4-9ae674ae460e",
                        "target_lang_word": "wrong",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wrong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incorrect or untrue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b16d3dbb-a5d8-490e-ae82-8e19273cfa3d",
                                                "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                                "text": "Some of your answers were correct, and some were wrong."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d13b523-7ee4-45fd-bad2-4b7949653010",
                                                "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                                "text": "Among this princely heap, if any here / By false intelligence or wrong surmise / Hold me a foe […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cb7faed-8075-4bc5-8436-1f25c5188a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                                "text": "You are not wrong, who deem / That my days have been a dream; / Yet if hope has flown away / In a night, or in a day, / In a vision, or in none, / Is it therefore the less gone?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31af474f-5e31-41fb-8da4-c671881fefc6",
                                                "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                                "text": "In this respect then, Gabriel's repetitive lyric of everyone playing: “games without frontiers and war without tears” was on the one hand quite funnily wrong. 'It's a Knockout' produced tears of laughter. […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86b13dc1-ffa4-43fb-a069-c7eb4c0e0fba",
                                                "sense_id": "cac6049e-f9fa-3ba0-9448-dad8ec9919c8",
                                                "text": "Throughout this time, Mystic Wolmar has been trying his luck and mostly getting it wrong - especially in 2006, when he got virtually everything wrong, including the departure of Tony Blair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b82d024b-3ad1-300c-8a2d-1d0ab18ae743",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Asserting something incorrect or untrue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b5ffa0b-be56-415d-b62c-19f64f733841",
                                                "sense_id": "b82d024b-3ad1-300c-8a2d-1d0ab18ae743",
                                                "text": "You're wrong: he's not Superman at all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d57d1698-8ab5-32b0-8170-56c24715ee5f",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Immoral, not good, bad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54c291f-f054-4e76-940d-d29b6dc4b3c5",
                                                "sense_id": "d57d1698-8ab5-32b0-8170-56c24715ee5f",
                                                "text": "It is wrong to lie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a748734f-576a-4e17-8409-b520b2bc3699",
                                                "sense_id": "d57d1698-8ab5-32b0-8170-56c24715ee5f",
                                                "text": "Shepard: Some part of you must still realize this is wrong. You can fight this!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7762bf10-f85d-32b2-90f3-9803d44b830a",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Improper; unfit; unsuitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f849460-c7e4-4d98-9571-7d4eba2a751f",
                                                "sense_id": "7762bf10-f85d-32b2-90f3-9803d44b830a",
                                                "text": "A bikini is the wrong thing to wear on a cold day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "833eb285-24d5-3df1-9960-be7c0c30ae68",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not working; out of order."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d985bc0-23de-4170-9906-618ef87683a3",
                                                "sense_id": "833eb285-24d5-3df1-9960-be7c0c30ae68",
                                                "text": "Something is wrong with my cellphone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb4a03ff-0ca8-46e4-aaec-e89e39c56fe3",
                                                "sense_id": "833eb285-24d5-3df1-9960-be7c0c30ae68",
                                                "text": "Don't cry, honey. Tell me what's wrong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ef4c12a-a245-3a5f-9cd6-be3f622be22a",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Designed to be worn or placed inward"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34ec1d5c-25df-44d3-922a-2b64c661cf81",
                                                "sense_id": "5ef4c12a-a245-3a5f-9cd6-be3f622be22a",
                                                "text": "the wrong side of a garment or of a piece of cloth"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1174eac-b7a7-31b9-9f28-704cfe4a960b",
                                        "entry_id": "36d8a7cd-7706-3aaa-990e-787528e078b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Twisted; wry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b391713-278d-42b7-978c-ecb7a9ad6622",
                                                "sense_id": "b1174eac-b7a7-31b9-9f28-704cfe4a960b",
                                                "text": "a wrong nose"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wrong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2dcf8bec-c0df-30fb-b1bd-95fdb162d264",
                                        "entry_id": "28644438-1074-3652-a3b0-4d66eddd23cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a way that isn't right; incorrectly, wrongly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7b735dd-710c-416b-af6d-29bdd0451531",
                                                "sense_id": "2dcf8bec-c0df-30fb-b1bd-95fdb162d264",
                                                "text": "I spelled several names wrong in my address book."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1e96a94-66c4-4b9f-8198-80f6a2f4a979",
                                                "sense_id": "2dcf8bec-c0df-30fb-b1bd-95fdb162d264",
                                                "text": "You're doing it all wrong!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33cc2276-b697-4a33-8014-e5ad5fdd6098",
                                                "sense_id": "2dcf8bec-c0df-30fb-b1bd-95fdb162d264",
                                                "text": "`Then, just as I was, I walked out of the house and went to the recruiting-office, stating my age wrong.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wrong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d2a0e96-4171-3c07-a044-e3faae0de950",
                                        "entry_id": "d44ed29d-1e4a-351f-b6a6-9d45d7d0ba64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is immoral or not good."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef03cba4-4604-442e-9df2-2aae7b88a241",
                                                "sense_id": "2d2a0e96-4171-3c07-a044-e3faae0de950",
                                                "text": "Injustice is a heinous wrong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51ce9eec-0bb7-39bd-8898-6abd3e035dae",
                                        "entry_id": "d44ed29d-1e4a-351f-b6a6-9d45d7d0ba64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of wronging someone (sometimes with possessive to indicate the wrongdoer)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfc2958d-cbf8-4ce1-8552-a6a8577e9023",
                                                "sense_id": "51ce9eec-0bb7-39bd-8898-6abd3e035dae",
                                                "text": "Can she excuse my wrongs with Virtue's cloak? Shall I call her good when she proves unkind?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89f2f748-3fe4-3e7c-95c3-b2b7e6b7fb60",
                                        "entry_id": "d44ed29d-1e4a-351f-b6a6-9d45d7d0ba64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The incorrect or unjust position or opinion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38a48a4f-bec4-4dd0-be62-c1209e309b28",
                                                "sense_id": "89f2f748-3fe4-3e7c-95c3-b2b7e6b7fb60",
                                                "text": "I blame not her: she could say little less; She had the wrong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0ffc392-f64f-3578-aa6c-a2a657d544b7",
                                        "entry_id": "d44ed29d-1e4a-351f-b6a6-9d45d7d0ba64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The opposite of right; the concept of badness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a45751e5-49d6-42ae-9f3d-6d7d8b19a93a",
                                                "sense_id": "d0ffc392-f64f-3578-aa6c-a2a657d544b7",
                                                "text": "Thus much of this will make Black white, foul fair, wrong right, Base noble, old young, coward valiant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wrong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f09e3063-eeaa-34f5-80c1-30c3c1edc807",
                                        "entry_id": "1a80c3a2-1f3f-38f0-b05f-34f350bfacf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat unjustly; to injure or harm; to do wrong by."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "531d89c0-5fb8-4a94-a21f-22837105bbfb",
                                                "sense_id": "f09e3063-eeaa-34f5-80c1-30c3c1edc807",
                                                "text": "The dealer wronged us by selling us this lemon of a car."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9cb1b40-adce-4f2c-a9f5-d019f98cd3b5",
                                                "sense_id": "f09e3063-eeaa-34f5-80c1-30c3c1edc807",
                                                "text": "Thou dost then wrong me, as that slaughterer doth Which giveth many wounds when one will kill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fc55710-db9b-3cb9-9366-c2c7e327e6e2",
                                        "entry_id": "1a80c3a2-1f3f-38f0-b05f-34f350bfacf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deprive of some right, or to withhold some act of justice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d3a2757-5846-42a1-b3a1-fe63f441d7b6",
                                                "sense_id": "8fc55710-db9b-3cb9-9366-c2c7e327e6e2",
                                                "text": "... And might by no suit gain our audience. When we are wrong'd and would unfold our griefs, We are denied access unto his person Even by those men that most have done us wrong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f80db167-9bfa-3f27-bc49-7dd2d5801f3b",
                                        "entry_id": "1a80c3a2-1f3f-38f0-b05f-34f350bfacf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To slander; to impute evil to unjustly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4e04007-9bf4-436d-befc-e0dc5f9a692c",
                                                "sense_id": "f80db167-9bfa-3f27-bc49-7dd2d5801f3b",
                                                "text": "O masters! if I were dispos'd to stir Your hearts and minds to mutiny and rage, I should do Brutus wrong, and Cassius wrong, Who (you all know) are honorable men. I will not do them wrong; I rather choose To wrong the dead, to wrong myself and you, Than I will wrong such honorable men."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
